  "description": "\"I just need to date someone too!\"\nDohee Kang's had the biggest crush on her childhood friend, Jaehyuk Kim, for years. But after his girlfriend tells her to get her own boyfriend, Dohee declares she will. Handsome, but eccentric Wonyoung Goh, happens to overhear and takes an interest in her. Will love be able to bloom between them? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
